/*
  MFA Enrolment System — single-file Bun HTTPS server and mobile SPA.
  Run: bun app.ts
  Requirements 1–5: server-side sessions, CSRF, TLS, encrypted secrets,
  PBKDF2 recovery-code storage, validation, lockouts, and safe headers.
